Suggests: sbuild, pbuilder, lxd | lxd-installer
Description: Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 cloud image and deb packaging pipeline
 CloudImageForge creates and manages Ubuntu jammy and noble cloud images,
 renders apt sources, builds debs with dpkg-deb/sbuild/pbuilder, and
 queries the Ubuntu Archive (Launchpad getPublishedSources) dataset.
 .
 Packages are published through a Launchpad-style staging archive. A
 fallback check boots a clean image (LXD/QEMU, or a simulated guest in
 CI) so an apt dependency that resolved on a dirty host cannot ship.
